<title>USA: Univ. of Alabama, $28.765 mln won by J.C. Bradford.</title>
<headline>Univ. of Alabama, $28.765 mln won by J.C. Bradford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford said it won $28.765 million of University of Alabama Board of Trustees, auxiliary revenue bonds, Series 1996-A, with a net interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
